{"seq":2,"slug":"state-machines","title":"动画状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/state-machines","wordCount":1257,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画状态机\">动画状态机</h1><p><a href=\"blend-trees\">混合空间与混合树</a> 解决了&quot;在一种运动里怎么连续融合&quot;，但角色的行为是离散的：要么在地面跑、要么在空中、要么在挥剑。从一种行为切到另一种、在什么条件下切、切换花多久、切到一半能不能反悔——这些&quot;离散选择 + 平滑过渡&quot;的逻辑，由动画状态机（Animation State Machine, ASM）管理。它是把一堆混合树组织成一个完整可控角色的骨架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>状态机由<strong>状态（state）</strong>、<strong>转换（transition）</strong> 和 <strong>参数（parameter）</strong> 三要素构成。每个状态内部是一棵混合树或单个片段；转换是状态间的有向边，带触发条件与混合时长；参数（速度、是否落地、攻击键按下）由游戏逻辑写入，转换条件读取它们决定是否跳转。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Idle[Idle 静立] --&gt;|速度 &gt; 0.1| Locomotion[Locomotion 移动混合树]&#10;  Locomotion --&gt;|速度 &lt; 0.1| Idle&#10;  Locomotion --&gt;|按下跳跃| Jump[Jump 起跳]&#10;  Idle --&gt;|按下跳跃| Jump&#10;  Jump --&gt;|垂直速度 &lt; 0| Fall[Fall 下落]&#10;  Fall --&gt;|检测到落地| Land[Land 落地缓冲]&#10;  Land --&gt;|动画结束| Idle\">flowchart TD\n  Idle[Idle 静立] --&gt;|速度 &gt; 0.1| Locomotion[Locomotion 移动混合树]\n  Locomotion --&gt;|速度 &lt; 0.1| Idle\n  Locomotion --&gt;|按下跳跃| Jump[Jump 起跳]\n  Idle --&gt;|按下跳跃| Jump\n  Jump --&gt;|垂直速度 &lt; 0| Fall[Fall 下落]\n  Fall --&gt;|检测到落地| Land[Land 落地缓冲]\n  Land --&gt;|动画结束| Idle</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>持有一段动画/混合树</td>\n<td>是否循环、播放速率、进入/退出事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换</td>\n<td>状态间跳转</td>\n<td>条件、混合时长、是否可打断、退出时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数</td>\n<td>逻辑与动画的接口</td>\n<td>float/bool/trigger，由游戏代码写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认状态</td>\n<td>进入状态机的入口</td>\n<td>每个状态机/子状态机一个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"转换与交叉淡化\">转换与交叉淡化</h2><p>转换发生时不能瞬切，否则角色会&quot;啪&quot;地弹一下。标准做法是<strong>交叉淡化（cross-fade）</strong>：在混合时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 内，旧状态权重从 1 线性降到 0，新状态从 0 升到 1，二者每帧按当前权重做姿态混合。设转换已进行时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，则新状态权重</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>τ</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{new}} = \\mathrm{clamp}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\tau}{T},\\, 0,\\, 1\\right), \\quad P = (1 - w_{\\text{new}})\\,P_{\\text{old}} + w_{\\text{new}}\\,P_{\\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>混合时长是手感的关键旋钮：太短显得机械，太长显得拖沓且&quot;糊&quot;。攻击响应可能只给 0.05 秒，而站立到行走可能给 0.25 秒。注意交叉淡化期间两个状态都在推进自己的时间轴，所以脚步相位仍要对齐，否则过渡中会滑步——这又回到 <a href=\"blend-trees\">混合空间与混合树</a> 的相位同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"条件-退出时间与可打断性\">条件、退出时间与可打断性</h2><p>转换条件分两类。<strong>参数条件</strong>：<code>速度 &gt; 0.1</code>、<code>isGrounded == true</code>，随时满足随时跳。<strong>退出时间（exit time）</strong>：要求源动画播到某个归一化进度才允许跳，用于&quot;必须打完这一拳才能接下一拳&quot;。两者可组合。</p>\n<p>可打断性是实时动画最棘手的设计。一个挥剑动作通常分<strong>前摇—命中—后摇</strong>三段：前摇可被翻滚打断（取消攻击），命中帧不可打断（保证判定），后摇可被下一次攻击打断（连招）。这要求转换能标注&quot;仅在源动画某帧区间内有效&quot;。把这套规则塞进状态机会让图迅速爆炸成意大利面——这正是 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/motion-matching\">动作匹配与运动场</a> 试图绕开手搭状态机的核心痛点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层状态机与子状态机\">分层状态机与子状态机</h2><p>复杂角色的状态机会用两种手段控制复杂度。<strong>子状态机（sub-state machine）</strong> 把一组相关状态（如所有空中状态）折叠成一个超级状态，内部再展开，类似函数封装。<strong>分层状态机</strong> 则让多个状态机并行运行在不同身体部位——一个管全身移动，另一个管上半身动作——各自独立转换，最后叠加。后者依赖骨骼遮罩，是 <a href=\"layering-masking\">分层与遮罩</a> 的主题，这里只指出：状态机本身可以是分层的，分层不只是混合层的概念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机的工程边界\">状态机的工程边界</h2><p>状态机擅长<strong>有限、可枚举、设计师想精确掌控</strong>的行为逻辑：技能连招、交互动作、明确的状态切换。它不擅长<strong>高维连续</strong>的运动——给八方向移动再加上加速度、转身急停、各种地形适配，状态数会组合爆炸。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>状态机擅长</th>\n<th>状态机吃力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行为本质</td>\n<td>离散、可枚举</td>\n<td>高维连续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计控制度</td>\n<td>精确可控</td>\n<td>难手工调全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据规模</td>\n<td>几十段片段</td>\n<td>上千段动捕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>技能/交互/连招</td>\n<td>自然移动/过渡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代 3A 项目常是&quot;混合&quot;架构：用状态机管技能与高层行为，把自然移动那部分交给动作匹配。理解状态机的边界，正是理解为什么第四章要引入运动场范式的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>状态机 = 状态（持混合树）+ 转换（带条件/时长）+ 参数（逻辑接口）。</li>\n<li>转换用交叉淡化平滑过渡，混合时长是关键手感旋钮，期间仍需相位对齐。</li>\n<li>条件分参数条件与退出时间；可打断性按动作的前摇/命中/后摇分段设计。</li>\n<li>子状态机封装复杂度，分层状态机让不同身体部位并行（依赖遮罩）。</li>\n<li>状态机擅长离散可控逻辑、不擅高维连续运动，故现代项目常与动作匹配混合使用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画状态机","id":"动画状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"转换与交叉淡化","id":"转换与交叉淡化"},{"level":2,"text":"条件、退出时间与可打断性","id":"条件-退出时间与可打断性"},{"level":2,"text":"分层状态机与子状态机","id":"分层状态机与子状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机的工程边界","id":"状态机的工程边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混合空间与混合树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/blend-trees"},"next":{"title":"分层与遮罩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/layering-masking"}}